  <article class="legal-content"><span class="eyebrow">Website information</span><h1>Terms.</h1><h2>About this website</h2><p>nrth.group is the public website for NRTH Inc. Its project introductions describe areas of focus and exploration. They do not establish that a particular product, service, feature, or integration is currently available.</p><h2>Project information</h2><p>Contact NRTH to discuss current scope, availability, or partnership opportunities. Product access, service agreements, and other commercial arrangements require their own applicable information and terms.</p><h2>General information</h2><p>The website’s articles share general perspectives. They are not medical advice, chemical safety instructions, or professional guidance for a particular situation.</p><h2>Using the site</h2><p>Please use the website lawfully and avoid attempts to interfere with its operation. The NRTH identity and original website materials should not be presented as an endorsement of an unrelated business or offering.</p><h2>External destinations</h2><p>Your email application and any external websites operate separately from this website. Review their own terms and privacy information when using them.</p><h2>Questions</h2><p>Visit <a href="/contact">Contact NRTH</a> to prepare an inquiry.</p></article>
